<title>USA: TABLE - Birmingham Steel Corp Q4 shr $0.05.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Birmingham Steel Corp Q4 shr $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended   Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues		     $277,528 $230,782 $978,948 $832,489</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     1,555    3,386   14,417  (2,177)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share     .05	.12	.50    (.08)</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding</p>
<p>				    29,677   28,609   29,091   28,566</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Included in the fourth quarter results were pre-tax charges of roughly $4.5 million, or $.09 per share after tax, related to start-up losses and other charges associated with a new steel scrap processing joint venture and a write-off of assets.</p>
<p>In the same period of the previous fiscal year, net income was $3.386 million, or $0.12 per share, including pre-tax charges of $2.5 million, or $.05 per share after tax.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
